Did you take out the seconds timer and flip it over?

Did you make a copy of the robot that you just trained to subtract when
the number gets too big?

Did you flip the seconds timer over and put it back in the box?

Did you put the robot copy on the back of the minutes timer?

Did you put the box with the -60 on the back of the minutes timer?

Did you flip the timers back over and put them back in the box?

So this is what I'd do.  I'd take the seconds timer out and flip it over.  I'd
take out the robot that you trained before to subtract when the number gets too
big.  Then I'd copy that robot.  I'd put the robot I took from the seconds
timer back.  I'd give him the box he had.  Then I'd flip the seconds timer over
and put it back in the box.  I'd flip over the minutes timer and put
the robot I just copied on the back.  And then give the robot the box with the -60 in
the fourth hole.  Then I'd flip the timer over and put it back in the
box and bring it back.


